# Kept out of every docker build context rooted here. Solution images build from
# the repo root (they COPY sibling component directories), so without this the
# whole repository — including every solution's outputs — is sent to the daemon.
# Nothing a Dockerfile COPYs is listed.
.git
.venv*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
# Solution run artifacts: config answers, outputs, fetched clips and weights.
**/out/
**/config.yaml
**/dist/
data_nocommit/
